hello I am Patricia bright and I am the  cover star of the spring/summer issue of  Glamour magazine coming out March 1st  and you're watching 10 things you didn't  know about me  the thing that no one ever told me about  being a youtube star is that I would be  judge jury and executioner it's almost  like a little bit of a enterprise where  I have to do everything and of course  that have support and amazing followers  but there is a lot more to do than I  could have ever imagined  the thing that I enjoy the most as part  of being a YouTube star it's probably  connecting and working with other people  filming in front of a camera in my  bedroom can be quite isolating but being  able to go out and connect with other  people and share ideas and talk to  brands and other influences or people  who do what I do is an amazing part  basically taught myself everything that  I know and I used YouTube to learn how  to work on YouTube there are so many  videos on how to edit yourself how to  take photos yourself how to sell  lighting yourself and these have been  invaluable in really improving my craft  what I know now that I didn't know ten  years ago was that life is long but also  sure and like the best years you can  have are probably ahead of you  when I was really really young I  couldn't wait to get older as I've got a  bit older I reminisce all the things  that I kind of did do or didn't do when  I was young but also realized that done  so much and then know that there's even  more I could keep doing I also didn't  know ten years ago that Britain would  leave the EU  the beauty product I can't live without  is probably night serum or night oil I  always do my skincare my really  important skincare at night and anything  that contains vitamin C as well one  night I'm using at the moment is from  DCL and it is a vitamin C booster which  it kind of has like a dr harold urey  consistency but it's really potent and  in the morning my face really glows  in my most private moments you'll  probably find me watching Netflix series  after next big series I get a little bit  addicted and whenever I'm having chill  out times I kind of over chill out and  I'll watch 10 episodes all at one go and  it'll be through the air but I'm like  why have I done this  when I'm in a bad mood I like to listen  to my sister she is what I call a voice  of reason if I'm having a bad day or  something's happening I pick up my phone  I talk to her and for some reason she's  always able to kind of calm me down make  me feel positive and a bit more centered  people come to me for a bit of a laugh a  bit of a laugh because I'm relatively  jovial but I think people also come to  me for that kind of hard-hitting advice  I often say things as it is and there's  some people who kind of need that kind  of kick from me and usually they  appreciate it  I shut down the haters by not giving  them any energy I focus on myself and my  own craft and my own grind and then I  let my success do the talking for me  I love being on the cover of Glamour  magazine because whose dream is it not  to be on the cover of a magazine  especially one that I've read for so  long I grew up on Glamour magazine I  didn't necessarily see people like  myself or just everyday girls to having  that opportunity there were people who I  looked up to who are on the covers of  the magazines and inside the magazines  as well and for me it's just  mind-boggling and out of this world to  be able to do that and I feel is worth  that there'll be a lot of other girls  like me normal everyday girls you're  gonna think you know maybe that could be  me which you never know it could be so  for more videos like this and if you  want to see what happened behind the  scenes of my color shoe make sure you  subscribe to the glamour UK youtube  channel
 

